### What Are the Edge Cases?

Edge cases include: a single balloon (just burst it, coins = the value since boundaries are both 1), two balloons (try both orders), and all balloons with value 1.

```java
package com.bank.core;

public class BurstEdgeCases {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // Single balloon
        System.out.println(BurstBalloons.maxCoins(new int[]{5}));  // 5 (1*5*1)

        // Two balloons
        System.out.println(BurstBalloons.maxCoins(new int[]{3, 5}));
        // Burst 3 first: 1*3*5 = 15, then 5: 1*5*1 = 5, total = 20
        // Burst 5 first: 3*5*1 = 15, then 3: 1*3*1 = 3, total = 18
        // Answer: 20
    }
}
```

